      "name": "adidas 3S Sprinter Shorts - Women's",
      "description": "<p>Embody the heart of sneaker culture with the adidas Adicolor 3-Stripes Sprinter Shorts. These satin knit shorts feature a loose fit and mid-rise waist for a baggy silhouette that captures street classic vibes. Crafted with recycled materials, they offer a smooth feel and bold look for your daily rotation.<br><ul><li>Satin fabric provides a smooth and glossy finish</li><li>Loose fit allows for a baggy and comfortable silhouette</li><li>Elastic waistband with pull-on closure ensures a secure fit</li><li>Curved hem and 3-Stripes detail add authentic athletic style</li><li>Embroidered Trefoil logo on the front showcases brand heritage</li></ul><br><b>Material & Care</b><br><ul><li>97% recycled polyester/3% elastane</li><li>Washable</li></ul><br><b>Size & Fit</b><br><ul><li>Loose fit</li><li>Mid rise</li><li>Above-thigh length</li></ul></p>",
